------------------------

The operative text of the Open Source Evolution License, Version 0.1, in:

- LICENSES/OSEL-0.1.txt
- LICENSES/OSEL-0.1.md

is dedicated to the public domain under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0
Universal Public Domain Dedication.

https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

To the extent possible under law, the persons who associated CC0 with the
OSEL license text have waived all copyright and related or neighboring
rights to that text. The purpose is to let anyone copy, adopt, and modify
the license text.

CC0 applies to the license text as a literary work. It does not change the
meaning of OSEL when OSEL is applied to software, and it does not make
software released under OSEL public-domain software.

